                <p rendition="#center">[Enclosures.]</p>
                <p>1. Mr. Adams to Lord Russell, April 16, 1864.</p>
                <p>2. Mr. Morse to Mr. Adams, (extracts,) April 12, 1864.</p>
                <p>3. Deposition of Robert Sadd April 9, 1864.</p>
                <p>4. Deposition of Joseph Sullivan, April 9, 1864.</p>
                <p>5. Deposition of Edward Smith, D. Conuell, and James Grace, April 12, 1864.</p>
                <p>6. Deposition of James Graham, April 4, 1864.</p>
                <p>7. Deposition of Charles Bennett, February 17, 1864.</p>
                <p>8. Deposition of Robert Dunn, February 29, 1864.</p>
                <p>9. Deposition of Ludwig Kritchiner, F. Slandt, Joseph Trunck, F. Junger, John
                    Panell, and H. Jessen, March 4, 1864.</p>
                <p>10. Deposition of Thomas Monk, March 15, 1864.</p>
                <p>11. Deposition of James Conner, March 21, 1864.</p>
                <p>12. Deposition of John Yard, March 21, 1864.</p>
                <p>13. Deposition of Thomas Shrouder, Samuel Garland, and Thomas Woods, March 28,
                    1864.</p>
                <p>14. Deposition of John Don, John Pratt, and Walker Dixon, March 31, 1864.</p>
                <p>15. Lord Russell to Mr. Adams, March 18, 1864.</p>
                <p>16. The Times, March 26, 1864.</p>


























